:y5k25LaGAqAAZQzG a ontouml:Class ;
    ontouml:description "Sublunary bodies are located under the Celestial Sphere of the Moon. They include the Earth – the center of the universe, ad all the natural (e.g. minerals, living beings, humans) and man-made objects (e.g. houses, statues) in the Earth. Sublunary bodies can move naturally – depending on the Nature of the Sublunary Matter they are composed of -, and can have forced movements." ;
    ontouml:isAbstract false ;
    ontouml:isDerived false ;
    ontouml:isExtensional false ;
